<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer ups paper stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer ups paper stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer upgraded several paper stocks, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- raised Temple-Inland Inc, Mead Corp and Willamette Industries Inc to buy from market perform, the source said.</p>
<p>-- raised Gaylord Container Corp to buy from outperform, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
